      "cooked": "<p>so was messing around trying to build a modular and I noticed the Green Switch power is a boost action and the Yellow Quick switch needs you to destroy a bonus you created if you take a mode prohibited from taking Boost actions there is a good chance you might get trapped in that mode<br>\nyou could hold the boost created when you Switched the first time but if a villain removes your bonuses…<br>\nam I missing something? Did I miss the first thread about this? I know Modular is not great but the actions and chunkiness works better for my heroic mad scientist than other archetypes</p>",
