      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/4491bb/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2020-04-14T06:02:34.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>You partially correct.<br>\nEven if your mode does not allow you to take the Boost action, you can still use Switch Mode to enter a different mode. You simply will not get a Boost action while doing so. If a villain removes all of the bonuses you made, then you will be unable to use Quick Switch due there being nothing available for it to eat.</p>",
